     "<div>Dear all, <br></div><div><br></div><div>For those who are interested in using interaction effects in lavaan, you can check out the ModSEM package on github <a href=\"https://github.com/Kss2k/modsem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/Kss2k/modsem&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414590906000&amp;usg=AOvVaw061BFvQejYdNs3CxjgKhVQ\">https://github.com/Kss2k/modsem</a> <br></div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Kjell<br></div>"
    ]
