   "date": "2024-06-11T09:31:08Z",
   "subject": "Re: Estimating Interaction/Moderating Effects",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "Wow, this looks like a great package that offers more than the interactions suite in semTools.  I noticed you wrote your own product-indicator functionality instead of depending on<font face=\"Courier New\"> semTools::prodInd()</font>, which makes quality-control comparisons possible.  I love that your packages automates the model specification!  However, I didn&#39;t notice any probing functionality in your vignettes.  I bet it would be possible to pass your fitted lavaan model (which is in the list your<font face=\"Courier New\"> modsem() </font>function returns) to<font face=\"Courier New\"> semTools::probe2wayMC() </font>or *RC().  Have you tried that?  Let me know if I can help get that working, to add a probing example to your modsem tutorial.<div><br></div><div>Thanks for the great work!<br><div><br></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px\"><div><p style=\"margin:0cm;line-height:normal;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:1.2\">Terrence D. Jorgensen </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:1.2\">   (he, him, his)</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;line-height:1.2\"><br>Assistant Professor, Methods and Statistics<br>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam<br><a href=\"https://eur04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Furldefense.com%2Fv3%2F__http%3A%2Fwww.uva.nl%2Fprofile%2Ft.d.jorgensen__%3B!!D9dNQwwGXtA!RdmdUd4WPRh7g7WAPQViCxUMWWjfCFpYPBs_GolbBQ-8m6MZFr9q93hgVEl4SnZ0IqPtX17qKMdVIrknwgORIVJK-9w%24&amp;data=05%...%40uva.nl%7C787cddbcbb304d36cd2808dc896574a6%7Ca0f1cacd618c4403b94576fb3d6874e5%7C0%7C0%7C638536316050859803%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=m0lXbiRM61LU8SlXmHCEAbZGCI%2F39ZSVK%2FOV6SuCMpY%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL:\nhttps://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen_